  <Program_Descriptions>
    <English>
      <Keywords>Audio &amp; Multimedia, Video Tools, profanity removal</Keywords>
      <Char_Desc_450>
Defilthify is a tool for removing profanity from movies, video, and audio files.
It creates subtitles from the audio of a video file or an audio file, removes the profanity from both the subtitles and the audio, replacing it with either silence (mute) or tone (bleep), and re-merges the three components (video, audio, &amp; subtitles) back into an output file.
There is no need for Adobe Premiere, Final Cut, DaVinci Resolve, Avid, or any other NLE.
</Char_Desc_450>
